---
import { appPath, CORPORATE_URL } from '../lib/urls';

const loginUrl = appPath('/login');
const iconSrc = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}favicon.svg`;
---

<footer class="border-t border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-900 pt-20 pb-10 text-neutral-400">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8">
    <div class="animate-on-scroll slide-up mb-16 text-center headline-fit-wrap">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl" data-headline-fit>
        SNS運用を、次のレベルへ。
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-neutral-400" data-jp-wrap>
        複雑な運用はAIに任せ、あなたは本業に集中するだけ。
      </p>
      <a
        href={loginUrl}
        class="mt-8 inline-flex bg-white px-10 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100"
      >
        無料アカウントを作成
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 border-t border-neutral-800 pt-12 md:grid-cols-5">
      <div class="col-span-2">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <img src={iconSrc} alt="" width="32" height="32" class="h-8 w-8 object-contain" />
          <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">BuzzIt</span>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-500">
          SNSを伸ばすだけでなく、店舗の投稿・集客・売上をまとめて支えるクラウドサービス。美容室・飲食店・クリニック向け。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold text-white">サービス</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href="#how-it-works" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">使い方</a></li>
          <li><a href="#features" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">機能一覧</a></li>
          <li><a href="#line-cost" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">LINE料金</a></li>
          <li><a href="#pricing" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">料金プラン</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">よくある質問</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}guide/`} class="transition-colors hover:text-white">使い方ガイド</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}blog/`} class="transition-colors hover:text-white">ブログ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold text-white">会社</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href={CORPORATE_URL} class="transition-colors hover:text-white">会社概要</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold text-white">法的情報</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><span class="text-neutral-600">利用規約（準備中）</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-neutral-600">プライバシー（準備中）</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 border-t border-neutral-800 pt-8 text-center text-xs md:text-left">
      <p>© 2026 株式会社シゴトク. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
